{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_058FC0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"那个<R=研究设施,LAB>里只有两个女人吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=研究设施,LAB>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"平时就我们两个。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"唔……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"其中一个你只听过声音，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"嗯。好听得让我脊背发麻。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"另一个是什么样的女人？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"你盯上她也没用。她好像对男人没兴趣。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不，我是因为任务……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"开玩笑的。让我想想……<R=年龄,AGE>大概三十多岁。人很漂亮，身材也好，不过不怎么打扮。是个相当古怪的人。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=年龄,AGE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":149,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"她在研究<R=人工智能,AI>？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=人工智能,AI>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":34,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"<R=人工智能,AI>？她研究的是<R=人工智能,AI>？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=人工智能,AI>\", \"<R=人工智能,AI>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"说起来，她还说过人类不该去宇宙。说宇宙对人类来说太危险。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"是为了自动控制火箭吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"她还说想“更接近那个人的遗志”。那说的大概是以前的恋人吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"恋人……也是女人？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"你对女人之间的关系还真感兴趣。想知道吗